<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak June CPI +0.3 pct mo/mo vs +0.1 pct in May.</title>
<headline>Slovak June CPI +0.3 pct mo/mo vs +0.1 pct in May.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovak consumer prices rose 0.3 percent in June after 0.1 percent in May, putting year-on-year inflation at 6.2 percent, the Slovak Statistical Bureau (SUSR) said on Monday.</p>
</text>
